# TR House Telvanni: "Knowledge from Beyond" (TR_m2_HT_Vaerin_q2). Vaerin's "chores" adds "capture a soul" (10,
# adds "Sittali"): the wraith in the Sittali ruin near Vhul. With its soul in a gem, "I have his soul right here."
# (Choice 1) logs 100 (RemoveSoulGem, Vaerin's hat, +5 reputation).
# The AddItem stands in for buying an empty grand gem; the console cast of Skyrim's Soul Trap (0004DBA4) for the
# player casting it, the kill for the fight. Sittali's ref is 09CA9951 (TR_Mainland's slot 09).
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ht_vaerin_q1_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ht_vaerin_q2_start
run
player->PositionCell 5367 3780 17690 0 "Alt Bosara, Tel Vaerin"
until 600 "TR_m2_Master_Vaerin"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Master_Vaerin
ask chores
ask capture a soul
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_HT_Vaerin_q2 == 10
bye
end

case ht_vaerin_q2_sittali
run
player->AddItem "Misc_SoulGem_Grand" 1
player->PositionCell 4072 1100 13575 0 "Sittali"
until 600 "TR_m3_AncG_Sittali"->GetDistance player < 1000
wait 120
console player.cast 0004DBA4 09CA9951 right
wait 30
console 09CA9951.kill
until 600 player->HasSoulGem "TR_m3_AncG_Sittali" >= 1
end

case ht_vaerin_q2_done
run
player->PositionCell 5367 3780 17690 0 "Alt Bosara, Tel Vaerin"
until 600 "TR_m2_Master_Vaerin"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Master_Vaerin
ask capture a soul
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_HT_Vaerin_q2 == 100
expect player->GetItemCount "TR_m2_q_VaerinHat" == 1
expect player->HasSoulGem "TR_m3_AncG_Sittali" == 0
bye
end
